          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Amped: Basic 4 activates 120% each, 600% base\nCycle: Amped but for Discard and drawing, condition is a bit less consistent\nAegis: Dog bad only proc twice and getting hit is an absolutely terrible condition\nBlink: 0 Cost to use and has retrieve for 4x (then 2x) but base is 240%\nUnbound: Ap and 1 Cost usage very easy to proc, 2 AP to equivalent base damage, bigger nukeability"
