            "en": "Flow 1: Discard 2 if you want, with only a bit of damage upside, not sure if its 1 or 2 hits\nFlow 2: Discard 1 if you want, but if not just Proc a Light/Dark of your choice and is 0 cost? Its great\nFlow 3: Why you ever even want the Decrease Cost of 120% base damage\nFlow 4: 800% base damage is quite a large hit you can build up to\nFlow 5: 5 Justice Cards for 75% Multiplicative on RW's massive base damage is pretty crazy"
