            "en": "Resonance 1: Activate for more Sword Tassel and hits but 1 AP each\nResonance 2: Self draw stapled on, amazing\nResonance 3: Best with Blink with its high base damage and actual usability\nResonance 4: Potentially good, but GR will tell\nResonance 5: Basically Resonance 4 but for more AP, wouldn't recommend really"
